        }
      ],
      "biographies": [
        "An invented LDP Diet member who developed a following through constituency casework and organizing legislative committees. A hypothetical leadership bid would seek nominations from fellow LDP Diet members and support within the party electorate. No part of this career is a claim about a real person or a predicted winner.",
        "An invented former regional administrator who subsequently became an LDP Diet member. Their fictional career connects prefectural concerns with national legislation; a hypothetical presidential candidacy would still need support from fellow party Diet members. This regional-to-Diet career is authored game fiction.",
        "An invented LDP Diet member specializing in budget scrutiny and economic-policy proposals. Their fictional leadership pitch emphasizes explaining fiscal choices to legislators and party members while seeking the required Diet-member nominations. The expertise, career and candidacy are invented, not researched personal facts.",
        "An invented LDP Diet member whose fictional career centers on negotiating legislation and coordinating parliamentary colleagues. A possible party-leadership bid would seek Diet-member nominations and backing across the party electorate. These negotiations and future ambitions are game fiction, not a forecast."
      ]
    }
